    "source_title": "依据公告文字四至、约 11.4 平方公里面积约束与 OSM 实测京张走廊线形推定的临时边界",
    "derivation_method": "公告将总体设计范围定义为“京张遗址公园周边 1—2 公里的城市地区和产业区”，北至北五环路、南至西直门外大街。该定义以走廊为参照，因此本边界以 OSM 实测京张（京包）走廊为中心线，南北取公告文字四至（39.9415N—40.0300N），半宽以 EPSG:4548 面积拟合至公告约 11.4 平方公里，解得半宽 0.579 km。仓库原临时矩形（PROV-SITE-001）按文字四至拟合但未参照坐标，经 OSM 校核其北段位于实测走廊以东约 2 km，未包含走廊本体；该矩形已完整保留在 constraints.geojson 中并在图纸上标注差异，供组织方复核。",
    "derivation_method_en": "The announcement defines the overall design area as the urban and industrial areas within 1-2 km around the Jing-Zhang heritage park, bounded north by the North Fifth Ring and south by Xizhimenwai Street - a corridor-relative definition. This boundary therefore centres on the surveyed Jing-Zhang alignment (OSM, ODbL), takes the announcement's north-south extents, and solves the half-width (0.579 km) so the EPSG:4548 area matches the announced ~11.4 km2. The repository rectangle is retained verbatim in constraints.geojson with its deviation measured.",
